<style>
#loading-overlay { position:fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; z-index:9999; font-size:1.2rem; color:#2563eb; font-weight:600; }
</style>
<script>
  document.title = "Loading...";
  setTimeout(function() {
    document.getElementById('loading-overlay').style.display = 'none';
    document.title = "Dynamic Loading | Example 5";
  }, 5000);
</script>

<div id="loading-overlay"><i class="fa fa-cog fa-spin" style="margin-right:0.5rem;"></i> Loading...</div>

<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/dynamic_loading" class="back-link">← Back to Dynamic Loading</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">Dynamic Loading — Example 5</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner"><ul>
    <li>A full-page overlay blocks interaction for 5 seconds on load</li>
    <li>Wait for the overlay to disappear before interacting with the form</li>
    <li>Use credentials: <strong>tomsmith</strong> / <strong>SuperSecretPassword</strong></li>
  </ul></div>

  <h4>Example 5: Loading overlay that disappears after 5 seconds</h4>

  <div style="margin-top:1rem; max-width:420px;">
    <p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Enter <em>tomsmith</em> / <em>SuperSecretPassword</em></p>
    <form name="login" id="login" action="/authenticate_dynamic_loading_5" method="post">
      <div style="margin-bottom:0.8rem;">
        <label for="username" style="font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Username</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="username" name="username" style="width:100%; padding:0.5rem; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px;" />
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <label for="pwd" style="font-weight:600; display:block; margin-bottom:0.3rem;">Password</label>
        <input type="password" class="form-control" id="pwd" name="password" style="width:100%; padding:0.5rem; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius:6px;" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:0.6rem 1.5rem;">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
